# Pacific Life — Brand Sponsorship Scorecard (workbooks-as-code).
# Usage: python3 build_pacific_life.py <SIGMA_BASE_URL> <TOKEN> <CONNECTION_ID> <FOLDER_ID>
#
# A two-page brand-investment app for Pacific Life's golf-event sponsorship portfolio:
#   Page 1  Aggregate Event Scorecard (leadership / export)  — comparative gradient KPI
#           cards (Actual vs Target), a live CallText AI insight, a native "Sponsorship
#           Value Map" scatter (Spend vs ROI, colored by finance segment), an ROI-by-event
#           bar, a segment roll-up pivot, and an export-ready per-event scorecard table.
#   Page 2  Request & Approval Workflow (Marketing + Finance + Brand Council) — an
#           +Add Event request modal, an events input-table grid where Finance sees
#           SUGGESTED targets from its usual formulas and can OVERRIDE them inline,
#           editable status pills for the request lifecycle, actuals + variance columns,
#           an append-only Activity Log, a Council-decision modal, and a workflow copilot.
#
# The whale + wordmark is Pacific Life's REAL brand asset (pacificlife.com); brand blue #1d58a4.
# All data is SYNTHETIC (SQL VALUES) — no real Pacific Life numbers.
